text: ["({B/P} can be paid with either {B} or 2 life.)\\nChoose target card in a graveyard other than a basic land card. Search its owner's graveyard, hand, and library for any number of cards with the same name as that card and exile them. Then that player shuffles.", '({B/P} can be paid with either {B} or 2 life.)\\nTarget creature gets -5/-5 until end of turn.', '({G/P} can be paid with either {G} or 2 life.)\\nTarget creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', '({R/P} can be paid with either {R} or 2 life.)\\nGut Shot deals 1 damage to any target.', '({U/B} can be paid with either {U} or {B}.)\\n{3}{U}: Target player draws a card. Activate only as a sorcery.\\n{3}{B}: Target player discards a card. Activate only as a sorcery.', '({U/P} can be paid with either {U} or 2 life.)\\nDraw two cards, then proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', '({W/P} can be paid with either {W} or 2 life.)\\nTarget artifact or creature you control gains protection from artifacts or from the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'Affinity for artifacts (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each artifact you control.)', 'Affinity for artifacts (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each artifact you control.)\\nDraw two cards.', 'Affinity for artifacts (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each artifact you control.)\\nFlying', 'All creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn.', "Annihilator 2 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices two permanents.)\\nUlamog's Crusher attacks each combat if able.", 'Apocalypse Hydra enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it. If X is 5 or more, it enters the battlefield with an additional X +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{1}{R}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Apocalypse Hydra: It deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Arcane spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\\nSpirit creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nDestroy target creature.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice any number of Spirits.\\nTarget player loses 2 life plus 2 life for each Spirit sacrificed this way. You gain that much life.', 'As long as Kor Duelist is equipped, it has double strike. (It deals both first-strike and regular combat damage.)', 'As long as Sunspear Shikari is equipped, it has first strike and lifelink.', "Ashenmoor Gouger can't block.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you control five or more lands, put four +1/+1 counters on Scute Mob.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, reveal the top card of your library and put that card into your hand. You lose life equal to its mana value.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you lose 1 life and create a 1/1 black Faerie Rogue creature token with flying.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you lose 1 life unless an opponent has 10 or less life.', "Azorius Chancery enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Azorius Chancery enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {W}{U}.", "Banefire deals X damage to any target.\\nIf X is 5 or more, this spell can't be countered and the damage can't be prevented.", 'Bloodthirst 1 (If an opponent was dealt damage this turn, this creature enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it.)\\nFirst strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', 'Bloodthirst 1 (If an opponent was dealt damage this turn, this creature enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it.)\\nFlying', 'Bloodthirst 2 (If an opponent was dealt damage this turn, this creature enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.)', 'Bloodthirst 2 (If an opponent was dealt damage this turn, this creature enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.)\\nLifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)', "Bloodthirst 2 (If an opponent was dealt damage this turn, this creature enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.)\\nMenace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", 'Bloodthirst 3 (If an opponent was dealt damage this turn, this creature enters the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it.)\\nFlying\\n{R}{R}{R}: Return Skarrgan Firebird from your graveyard to your hand. Activate only if an opponent was dealt damage this turn.', "Boros Garrison enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Boros Garrison enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {R}{W}.", 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nTarget creature gets +3/-3 and loses all creature types until end of turn.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nUntil end of turn, target creature has base power and toughness 4/4, gains all creature types, and gains flying.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nUp to two target creatures each get +2/+0 and gain all creature types until end of turn.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\n{1}{B}: Ghostly Changeling gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\n{X}: Until end of turn, creatures you control have base power and toughness X/X and gain all creature types.', 'Chimeric Mass enters the battlefield with X charge counters on it.\\n{1}: Until end of turn, Chimeric Mass becomes a Construct artifact creature with "This creature\'s power and toughness are each equal to the number of charge counters on it."', 'Choose one —\\n• Creatures you control get +2/+0 until end of turn.\\n• Creatures you control get +0/+2 until end of turn.', "Choose two —\\n• Counter target spell.\\n• Return target permanent to its owner's hand.\\n• Tap all creatures your opponents control.\\n• Draw a card.", "Choose two —\\n• Target player loses X life.\\n• Return target creature card with mana value X or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\n• Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn.\\n• Up to X target creatures gain fear until end of turn. (They can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'Colorless Eldrazi spells you cast cost {2} less to cast.\\n{7}, {T}: Search your library for a colorless creature card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\\nCreate three 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\\nCreatures you control get +3/+3 until end of turn.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\\nDestroy target artifact or enchantment.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\\nTap two untapped creatures you control: Root-Kin Ally gets +2/+2 until end of turn.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\\nWhen Conclave Phalanx enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life for each creature you control.", 'Counter target red or green spell.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.', "Counter target spell. If that spell is countered this way, put it into its owner's hand instead of into that player's graveyard.\\nDraw a card.", 'Court Homunculus gets +1/+1 as long as you control another artifact.', 'Create a 1/1 green Snake creature token, a 2/2 green Wolf creature token, and a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.', 'Create three 1/1 white Spirit creature tokens with flying.', 'Create two 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment. You gain life equal to its mana value.', "Destroy target artifact. Smash to Smithereens deals 3 damage to that artifact's controller.", 'Destroy target creature or land.', 'Destroy target creature with flying.', 'Destroy target creature, then proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'Destroy target green or white creature.', "Dimir Aqueduct enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Dimir Aqueduct enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {U}{B}.", "Domain — Matca Rioters's power and toughness are each equal to the number of basic land types among lands you control.", 'Domain — Tribal Flames deals X damage to any target, where X is the number of basic land types among lands you control.', 'Double strike', 'Double strike, protection from black and from green', 'Double strike\\n{B}{G}: Viashino Slaughtermaster gets +1/+1 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', 'Each player sacrifices all permanents they control that are one or more colors.', 'Each player sacrifices four lands. Wildfire deals 4 damage to each creature.', 'Electrolyze deals 2 damage divided as you choose among one or two targets.\\nDraw a card.', 'Enchant creature with another Aura attached to it\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3 and has first strike, vigilance, and lifelink. (Damage dealt by the creature also causes its controller to gain that much life.)', 'Enchant creature\\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if enchanted creature is untapped, tap it.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can\'t attack or block.\\nEnchanted creature has "At the beginning of your upkeep, you lose 1 life."', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has haste.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: Create a token that\'s a copy of this creature, except it has haste. Exile that token at the beginning of the next end step."', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+0 and has flying.\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+0 for each artifact you control.\\n{B}{B}: Attach Cranial Plating to target creature you control.\\nEquip {1}', "Equipped creature gets +2/+2 and can't block.\\nEquip {3} ({3}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", 'Equipped creature gets +4/+0.\\n{R}{W}, Unattach Sunforger: Search your library for a red or white instant card with mana value 4 or less and cast that card without paying its mana cost. Then shuffle.\\nEquip {3}', 'Etched Monstrosity enters the battlefield with five -1/-1 counters on it.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, Remove five -1/-1 counters from Etched Monstrosity: Target player draws three cards.', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\n{T}: Add {G}, {W}, or {U}.', 'Exile target black or red permanent.', "Exile target creature. At the beginning of the next end step, return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.", "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\\nWhenever Shadowmage Infiltrator deals combat damage to a player, you may draw a card.", 'Fiery Fall deals 5 damage to target creature.\\nBasic landcycling {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'First strike\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Until end of turn, Dragonsoul Knight becomes a Dragon, gets +5/+3, and gains flying and trample.', "Flash\\nFlying\\nWhen Vendilion Clique enters the battlefield, look at target player's hand. You may choose a nonland card from it. If you do, that player reveals the chosen card, puts it on the bottom of their library, then draws a card.", 'Flash\\nWhen Mystic Snake enters the battlefield, counter target spell.', 'Flying, double strike', 'Flying, haste\\nWhenever Hellkite Charger attacks, you may pay {5}{R}{R}. If you do, untap all attacking creatures and after this phase, there is an additional combat phase.', "Flying\\nAs Iona, Shield of Emeria enters the battlefield, choose a color.\\nYour opponents can't cast spells of the chosen color.", 'Flying\\nAttacking creatures you control get +2/+0.', 'Flying\\nCloud Elemental can block only creatures with flying.', "Flying\\nDaggerclaw Imp can't block.", 'Flying\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever a creature you control attacks alone, it gains lifelink until end of turn.', "Flying\\nIf a source would deal damage to Swans of Bryn Argoll, prevent that damage. The source's controller draws cards equal to the damage prevented this way.", "Flying\\nMetalcraft — Artifacts you control have shroud as long as you control three or more artifacts. (An artifact with shroud can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'Flying\\nMetalcraft — {U}: Exile Argent Sphinx. Return it to the battlefield under your control at the beginning of the next end step. Activate only if you control three or more artifacts.', 'Flying\\nWhen Faerie Mechanist enters the battlefield, look at the top three cards of your library. You may reveal an artifact card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', "Flying\\nWhen Mulldrifter enters the battlefield, draw two cards.\\nEvoke {2}{U} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", "Flying\\nWhen Puppeteer Clique enters the battlefield, put target creature card from an opponent's graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. It gains haste. At the beginning of your next end step, exile it.\\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", 'Flying\\nWhenever Thrummingbird deals combat damage to a player, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'Flying\\nWhenever another creature dies, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Scavenger Drake.', "Flying\\nWhenever you cast a Spirit or Arcane spell, you may exile Hikari, Twilight Guardian. If you do, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", 'Flying\\nWhenever you draw a card, Niv-Mizzet, the Firemind deals 1 damage to any target.\\n{T}: Draw a card.', 'Flying\\nYou may cast Worldheart Phoenix from your graveyard by paying {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} rather than paying its mana cost. If you do, it enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.', 'Flying\\n{2}{U}: Tap target creature with flying.', "For each color, return up to one target card of that color from your graveyard to your hand. Exile All Suns' Dawn.", "Golgari Rot Farm enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Golgari Rot Farm enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {B}{G}.", 'Graft 1 (This creature enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it. Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you may move a +1/+1 counter from this creature onto it.)', 'Graft 2 (This creature enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it. Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you may move a +1/+1 counter from this creature onto it.)\\n{1}{U}: Untap target creature with a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Graft 2 (This creature enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it. Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you may move a +1/+1 counter from this creature onto it.)\\n{G}: Target creature with a +1/+1 counter on it gains reach until end of turn. (It can block creatures with flying.)', 'Graft 3 (This creature enters the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it. Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you may move a +1/+1 counter from this creature onto it.)\\n{1}: Target creature with a +1/+1 counter on it gains flying until end of turn.', "Graft 3 (This creature enters the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it. Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you may move a +1/+1 counter from this creature onto it.)\\n{2}: Target creature with a +1/+1 counter on it gains shroud until end of turn. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'Graft 4 (This creature enters the battlefield with four +1/+1 counters on it. Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you may move a +1/+1 counter from this creature onto it.)\\nWhen Cytoplast Root-Kin enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each other creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it.\\n{2}: Move a +1/+1 counter from target creature you control onto Cytoplast Root-Kin.', 'Graft 4 (This creature enters the battlefield with four +1/+1 counters on it. Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you may move a +1/+1 counter from this creature onto it.)\\n{1}, Remove two +1/+1 counters from among creatures you control: Draw a card.', "Gruul Turf enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Gruul Turf enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {R}{G}.", "Guile can't be blocked except by three or more creatures.\\nIf a spell or ability you control would counter a spell, instead exile that spell and you may play that card without paying its mana cost.\\nWhen Guile is put into a graveyard from anywhere, shuffle it into its owner's library.", "Haste\\nThunderblust has trample as long as it has a -1/-1 counter on it.\\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", "Haste\\n{T}: Create a token that's a copy of target nonlegendary creature you control, except it has haste. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.", "If Leyline of Sanctity is in your opening hand, you may begin the game with it on the battlefield.\\nYou have hexproof. (You can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", 'Indestructible (Effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy this artifact.)\\nEquipped creature gets +2/+0.\\nEquip {2}', 'Indestructible\\n{T}: Add {C}.', "Izzet Boilerworks enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Izzet Boilerworks enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {U}{R}.", "Karplusan Strider can't be the target of blue or black spells.", 'Kicker {4} (You may pay an additional {4} as you cast this spell.)\\nBurst Lightning deals 2 damage to any target. If this spell was kicked, it deals 4 damage instead.', "Kicker {4} (You may pay an additional {4} as you cast this spell.)\\nConvoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\\nIf Kavu Primarch was kicked, it enters the battlefield with four +1/+1 counters on it.", "Kicker {G} (You may pay an additional {G} as you cast this spell.)\\nTarget creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control this turn. If this spell was kicked, that creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.", 'Lightning Bolt deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Living weapon (When this Equipment enters the battlefield, create a 0/0 black Phyrexian Germ creature token, then attach this to it.)\\nEquipped creature gets +0/+1 and has "Sacrifice this creature: This creature deals 1 damage to any target."\\nEquip {2}', 'Living weapon (When this Equipment enters the battlefield, create a 0/0 black Phyrexian Germ creature token, then attach this to it.)\\nEquipped creature gets +1/+1.\\nEquip {2}', 'Living weapon (When this Equipment enters the battlefield, create a 0/0 black Phyrexian Germ creature token, then attach this to it.)\\nEquipped creature gets +2/+2.\\nEquip {4}', 'Look at the top five cards of your library. You may reveal a creature card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Look at the top three cards of your library. Put one of those cards into your hand, one on top of your library, and one on the bottom of your library.', 'Metalcraft — Etched Champion has protection from all colors as long as you control three or more artifacts.', 'Metalcraft — Rusted Relic is a 5/5 Golem artifact creature as long as you control three or more artifacts.', 'Metalcraft — This spell costs {1} less to cast if you control three or more artifacts.\\nCounter target spell.', 'Metalcraft — {T}: Add one mana of any color. Activate only if you control three or more artifacts.', 'Multikicker {1} (You may pay an additional {1} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nChoose any target, then choose another target for each time this spell was kicked. Comet Storm deals X damage to each of them.', 'Multikicker {1}{G} (You may pay an additional {1}{G} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nGnarlid Pack enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each time it was kicked.', 'Multikicker {2} (You may pay an additional {2} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nEverflowing Chalice enters the battlefield with a charge counter on it for each time it was kicked.\\n{T}: Add {C} for each charge counter on Everflowing Chalice.', 'Multikicker {G} (You may pay an additional {G} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Wolfbriar Elemental enters the battlefield, create a 2/2 green Wolf creature token for each time it was kicked.', 'Nonartifact spells cost {1} more to cast.', "Orzhov Basilica enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Orzhov Basilica enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {W}{B}.", 'Other Elemental creatures you control get +1/+1.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: You may put an Elemental creature card from your hand onto the battlefield. That creature gains haste until end of turn. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.', 'Other black creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther green creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may create a 1/1 black and green Worm creature token.', 'Other green creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther white creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nIf a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard Wilt-Leaf Liege, put it onto the battlefield instead of putting it into your graveyard.', 'Proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)\\nDraw a card.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on each of X target creatures.', 'Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature, then proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature.\\nDraw a card.', "Rakdos Carnarium enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Rakdos Carnarium enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {B}{R}.", 'Return X target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Return all artifacts target player owns to their hand.', "Return target card from your graveyard to your hand. If you return a nonland card to your hand this way, Vengeful Rebirth deals damage equal to that card's mana value to any target.\\nExile Vengeful Rebirth.", "Return target creature to its owner's hand. Its controller loses 1 life.", "Return target nonland permanent with mana value X to its owner's hand.\\nDraw a card.", 'Sacrifice Fulminator Mage: Destroy target nonbasic land.', 'Sacrifice Kami of Ancient Law: Destroy target enchantment.', 'Sacrifice Moonlit Strider: Target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.\\nSoulshift 3 (When this creature dies, you may return target Spirit card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to your hand.)', 'Sacrifice Scuttling Death: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.\\nSoulshift 4 (When this creature dies, you may return target Spirit card with mana value 4 or less from your graveyard to your hand.)', 'Sacrifice a creature: Bloodthrone Vampire gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Savage Twister deals X damage to each creature.', "Scion of the Wild's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures you control.", 'Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {G}{W}.", "Shrewd Hatchling enters the battlefield with four -1/-1 counters on it.\\n{U/R}: Target creature can't block Shrewd Hatchling this turn.\\nWhenever you cast a blue spell, remove a -1/-1 counter from Shrewd Hatchling.\\nWhenever you cast a red spell, remove a -1/-1 counter from Shrewd Hatchling.", "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nWhenever another creature dies, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Algae Gharial.", "Simic Growth Chamber enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Simic Growth Chamber enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {G}{U}.", 'Sphere of the Suns enters the battlefield tapped and with three charge counters on it.\\n{T}, Remove a charge counter from Sphere of the Suns: Add one mana of any color.', 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\nFlying', 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\n{1}, Remove four +1/+1 counters from Etched Oracle: Target player draws three cards.', 'Sunlance deals 3 damage to target nonwhite creature.', 'Tap target creature.\\nMetalcraft — If you control three or more artifacts, exile that creature.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains flying until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -3/-0 until end of turn.\\nTarget creature gets -0/-3 until end of turn.', 'Target player discards two cards.', 'Target player draws two cards and loses 2 life.', 'Target player gains 8 life.\\nBasic landcycling {1}{G} ({1}{G}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', "Tarmogoyf's power is equal to the number of card types among cards in all graveyards and its toughness is equal to that number plus 1.", "This spell can't be countered.\\nCombust deals 5 damage to target white or blue creature. The damage can't be prevented.", "This spell can't be countered.\\nWhen you cast this spell, take an extra turn after this one.\\nFlying, protection from spells that are one or more colors, annihilator 6\\nWhen Emrakul, the Aeons Torn is put into a graveyard from anywhere, its owner shuffles their graveyard into their library.", 'Trample\\nTap an untapped artifact you control: Lodestone Myr gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Trample\\nWhen Pelakka Wurm enters the battlefield, you gain 7 life.\\nWhen Pelakka Wurm dies, draw a card.', 'Trample\\nWhenever Primeval Titan enters the battlefield or attacks, you may search your library for up to two land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Tumble Magnet enters the battlefield with three charge counters on it.\\n{T}, Remove a charge counter from Tumble Magnet: Tap target artifact or creature.', 'Until end of turn, creatures you control gain trample and get +X/+X, where X is the greatest power among creatures you control.', 'Until end of turn, target creature you control gets +3/+3 and other creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Vigilance, trample, haste\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: You may play target Elemental card from your graveyard without paying its mana cost.', 'Vigilance\\nOther creatures you control get +2/+2.\\nCreatures your opponents control get -2/-2.', "When Aethersnipe enters the battlefield, return target nonland permanent to its owner's hand.\\nEvoke {1}{U}{U} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", 'When Cathodion dies, add {C}{C}{C}.', 'When Dread Drone enters the battlefield, create two 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', "When Ghost Council of Orzhova enters the battlefield, target opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.\\n{1}, Sacrifice a creature: Exile Ghost Council of Orzhova. Return it to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", 'When Kozilek\'s Predator enters the battlefield, create two 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'When Nest Invader enters the battlefield, create a 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', "When Oblivion Ring enters the battlefield, exile another target nonland permanent.\\nWhen Oblivion Ring leaves the battlefield, return the exiled card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", 'When Precursor Golem enters the battlefield, create two 3/3 colorless Golem artifact creature tokens.\\nWhenever a player casts an instant or sorcery spell that targets only a single Golem, that player copies that spell for each other Golem that spell could target. Each copy targets a different one of those Golems.', 'When Runed Servitor dies, each player draws a card.', "When Spitebellows leaves the battlefield, it deals 6 damage to target creature.\\nEvoke {1}{R}{R} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", 'When Taj-Nar Swordsmith enters the battlefield, you may pay {X}. If you do, search your library for an Equipment card with mana value X or less, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'When Tukatongue Thallid dies, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', 'When you cast this spell, destroy target permanent.\\nIndestructible\\nAnnihilator 4 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices four permanents.)\\nWhen Ulamog, the Infinite Gyre is put into a graveyard from anywhere, its owner shuffles their graveyard into their library.', 'When you cast this spell, draw four cards.\\nAnnihilator 4 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices four permanents.)\\nWhen Kozilek, Butcher of Truth is put into a graveyard from anywhere, its owner shuffles their graveyard into their library.', 'When you cast this spell, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\nAnnihilator 2 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices two permanents.)', "Whenever another artifact enters the battlefield under your control, Glassdust Hulk gets +1/+1 until end of turn and can't be blocked this turn.\\nCycling {W/U} ({W/U}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", 'Whenever another artifact enters the battlefield under your control, you may have Glint Hawk Idol become a 2/2 Bird artifact creature with flying until end of turn.\\n{W}: Glint Hawk Idol becomes a 2/2 Bird artifact creature with flying until end of turn.', 'Whenever you cast a Spirit or Arcane spell, target opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.\\nSoulshift 2 (When this creature dies, you may return target Spirit card with mana value 2 or less from your graveyard to your hand.)', 'Whenever you cast a Spirit or Arcane spell, you may put a ki counter on Waxmane Baku.\\n{1}, Remove X ki counters from Waxmane Baku: Tap X target creatures.', "Whenever you cast a creature spell, create X 1/1 black Thrull creature tokens, where X is that spell's mana value.\\nWhen you control seven or more Thrulls, sacrifice Endrek Sahr, Master Breeder.", 'Whenever you cast a spell, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'Whenever you cast an artifact spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, create a 1/1 colorless Myr artifact creature token.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, you may put a charge counter on Surrakar Spellblade.\\nWhenever Surrakar Spellblade deals combat damage to a player, you may draw X cards, where X is the number of charge counters on it.', 'Whenever you draw a card, put a +1/+1 counter on Lorescale Coatl.', 'Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)', 'Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a -1/-1 counter on each nonblack creature.', 'Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\\nWhenever a creature an opponent controls with a -1/-1 counter on it dies, you may return that card to the battlefield under your control.', "Wrap in Flames deals 1 damage to each of up to three target creatures. Those creatures can't block this turn.", '[+1]: Untap up to two target artifacts.\\n[−X]: Search your library for an artifact card with mana value X or less, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.\\n[−5]: Artifacts you control become artifact creatures with base power and toughness 5/5 until end of turn.', '[+4]: Target player exiles a card from their hand.\\n[−3]: Exile target permanent.\\n[−14]: Restart the game, leaving in exile all non-Aura permanent cards exiled with Karn Liberated. Then put those cards onto the battlefield under your control.', '{1}{B}: Return Reassembling Skeleton from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', '{1}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Insect creature token.', '{1}{R}{R}: Spikeshot Elder deals damage equal to its power to any target.', '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Expedition Map: Search your library for a land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Wayfarer's Bauble: Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.", '{2}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard. Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', '{2}: Target creature gains trample until end of turn. If this is the third time this ability has resolved this turn, you may add {R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}.', '{2}{B}{G}, Sacrifice a creature: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Another target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.', '{2}{R}: Creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn. If this is the third time this ability has resolved this turn, creatures you control gain first strike until end of turn.', '{3}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.\\n{3}{W}: Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}, Sacrifice a creature: Put a charge counter on Culling Dais.\\n{1}, Sacrifice Culling Dais: Draw a card for each charge counter on Culling Dais.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add two mana in any combination of colors. Spend this mana only to cast Elemental spells or activate abilities of Elementals.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}: Blinkmoth Nexus becomes a 1/1 Blinkmoth artifact creature with flying until end of turn. It's still a land.\\n{1}, {T}: Target Blinkmoth creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {C}{C}. Spend this mana only to cast colorless Eldrazi spells or activate abilities of colorless Eldrazi.', "{T}: Bloodshot Trainee deals 4 damage to target creature. Activate only if Bloodshot Trainee's power is 4 or greater.", '{T}: Goblin Fireslinger deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.', '{U/P}: Change a target of target spell or ability to Spellskite. ({U/P} can be paid with either {U} or 2 life.)', '{U}: Gust-Skimmer gains flying until end of turn.', '{U}: Water Servant gets +1/-1 until end of turn.\\n{U}: Water Servant gets -1/+1 until end of turn.', "{W/B}{W/B}{W/B}: Restless Apparition gets +3/+3 until end of turn.\\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", '{W/P}, {T}: Tap target creature. ({W/P} can be paid with either {W} or 2 life.)']
flavor: ['"A great siege is a banquet to him; a long and terrible battle, the most exquisite delicacy."\\n—*The Seer\'s Parables*', '"Be silent and listen to your inner fire. Only then can you walk the Path of Flame."', '"Down here, we have a more pointed version of the scriptures."\\n—Urabrask\'s enforcer', '"Duty and law are the foundation on which civilization stands. They must not fall, for when they do, they take everything with them."\\n—Lord Konda', '"Every sword drawn to defend is an angelic blade, guided to justice by an angelic hand."\\n—Auriok proverb', '"Fire is the universal language."\\n—Jhoira, master artificer', '"For unwavering commitment and unflinching strength, the Order of the White Orchid confers its sigil. Rise, knight-captain, and do your duty."', '"Forswear the flesh and you will truly see."\\n—Jin-Gitaxias, Core Augur', '"Have you ever killed insects nibbling at your crops? I think that\'s what the Eldrazi believe they\'re doing to us."\\n—Sheyda, Ondu gamekeeper', '"I know just the person for that job."', '"I need never remember my past associates, my victims, my mistakes. Innistrad preserves them all for me."\\n—Sorin Markov', '"I trust the instincts of any beast over the advice of any human who presumes to be an expert in the art of war."\\n—Rinshel, elf insurgent', '"I use maps to find out where explorers have already been. Then I go the other way."\\n—Javad Nasrin, Ondu relic hunter', '"I\'ll fight two at once, and then lick their guts from my blades."', '"It\'s easy for the innocent to speak of justice. They seldom feel its terrible power."\\n—Orim, Samite inquisitor', '"It\'s so cute when it\'s sleeping, isn\'t it? Actually, it\'s still as abhorrent as ever, but at least it\'s not trying to kill us."\\n—Noyan Dar, Tazeem lullmage', '"Just think how strong I\'ll be if my arms don\'t tear off!"', '"Kill the queen first, or we\'ll be fighting her drones forever. It is not in a queen\'s nature to have enough servants."\\n—Borzard, exterminator captain', '"Let nothing own the skies but the wind."\\n—Dejara, Giltwood druid', '"Let the deception of the gods yield to the pure light of day."\\n—Brimaz, king of Oreskos', '"Let the song of Selesnya be heard above the rhythm of our thundering hordes!"', '"Let\'s show Vorinclex that progress doesn\'t always need teeth or claws."\\n—Malcator, Executor of Synthesis', '"Like dawn\'s first light, blind the unprepared and banish the shadows."\\n—Skyhunter creed', '"Look at her, once filled with innocence. Death has a way of wringing away such . . . deficiencies."\\n—Savra', '"More of that strange oil . . . It\'s probably nothing."', '"My battle cry reaches ears far keener than yours."\\n—Saidah, Joraga hunter', '"Nature is the ultimate mindless destroyer, capable of power and ferocity no army can match, and the Gruul follow its example."\\n—Trigori, Azorius senator', '"Ogres taunt the dragons by moving into their territory, but even the hellkites find them too much trouble to hunt."\\n—Marza, mountain scout', '"Once each year, the oni and other evil spirits paraded through villages to disturb mortals\' sleep. During the war, this parade became a nightly event."\\n—*Observations of the Kami War*', '"Our pyromancer\'s flames may not have killed them, but they bought us the time we needed."\\n—*The War Diaries*', '"See how gratefully this world accepts our blessings."\\n—Jin-Gitaxias, Core Augur', '"Somehow it warps the Æther. It brings a strange weight, a blockade in the flow of spellcraft."\\n—Noyan Dar, Tazeem lullmage', '"Survival rule 781: There are always more scute bugs."\\n—Zurdi, goblin shortcutter', '"Swords cannot reach far enough. Chains cannot strike hard enough. An eternal dilemma, but a simple one."', '"Sympathy is for weaklings. Whoever survives, wins."\\n—Benzir, archdruid of Temple Might', '"The Gitaxians whisper among themselves of other worlds. If they exist, we must bring Phyrexia\'s magnificence to them."', '"The Golgari expand, yes, but I refuse to call their tainted creations \'growth.\'"\\n—Veszka, Selesnya evangel', '"The changing kind suffers as we do. We must join as one to quench our tyrants!"', '"The emergence of the Eldrazi isn\'t necessarily a bad thing, as long as you\'ve already lived a fulfilling and complete life without regrets."\\n—Javad Nasrin, Ondu relic hunter', '"The enlightenment I never found in etherium I have found traced in the coatl\'s scales."\\n—Ranalus, vedalken heretic', '"The jeweler, the potter, the smith . . . They all imbue a bit of their souls into their creations. The kami destroy that crafted mortal shell and absorb the soul within."\\n—Noboru, master kitemaker', '"The landscape shimmered and I felt a chill breeze. When my vision cleared, I found myself alone among the corpses of my fallen friends."\\n—Journal found in Numai', '"The results of our ninth inoculation were the same. The specimen was, of course, euthanized before the contagion could spread."\\n—Vedalken research notes', '"The sky teems with just as much life as the forest or the deep seas."\\n—Hadi Kasten, Calla Dale naturalist', '"The southern fortress taken by invaders? Heh, sure . . . when elephants fly."\\n—Brezard Skeinbow, captain of the guard', '"They say only the good die young. Obviously, you are one of the exceptions."\\n—Delrobah, cleric of Ivora Gate', '"This creature has innate perceptiveness. It knows when to rise and when to vanish into the tides."\\n—Jestus Dreya, *Of Elements and Eternity*', '"This creature is inadequate. Send it to the splicers for innovation."\\n—Malcator, Executor of Synthesis', '"Those may be the squirms of one life ending or of another beginning. Either way, I\'d leave it alone."\\n—Rakka Mar', '"Unsafe Terrain Ahead—Turn Back"\\n—Sign near the former location of Pyrtagh Cairn', '"We coat ourselves in steel every day. What is etherium but the next logical step?"', '"We consider rust a curable disease."\\n—Tarrin, Hammer-Tribe shaman', '"We thank the souleaters for inscribing our souls with subservience, to reinforce the sacred order."\\n—Drones\' hymn of gratitude', '"We will fight as they do: our flesh protected behind metal."\\n—Tae Aquil, Viridian weaponsmith', '"Whatever the Eldrazi\'s purpose is, it has nothing to do with something so insignificant as us."\\n—Nirthu, lone missionary', '"When the fifth sun rose, Mirrodin saw its first true dawn."\\n—Inscribed on the skin of Thrun, the last troll', '"Where metal is tainted and wood is scarce, we are best armed by faith."\\n—Tavalus, acolyte of Korlis', '"Wind is forceful, yet ephemeral. It can knock a dragon out of the sky, yet pass through the smallest crack unhindered."\\n—Jestus Dreya, *Of Elements and Eternity*', '"You serve Phyrexia. Your pieces would better serve Phyrexia elsewhere."\\n—Azax-Azog, the Demon Thane', '"Your deed cannot be undone. You, however, can be."\\n—Agosto, Azorius imperator', '"Your downfall was not your ignorance, your weakness, or your hubris, but your warm blood."\\n—Heidar, Rimewind master', 'A great mirage, a dream of wings and silver.', 'A light an army can follow.', 'A rock between your eyes hurts. A burning rock between your eyes ruins your whole day.', 'A symbol of what Mirrodin once was and hope for what it will be again.', 'After his hands had crumbled away, leaving only wickedly sharp points, he decided his only purpose was war.', 'An eye closes. A race awakens.', 'Any being that harms them quickly learns its lesson.', 'As the dawns break, the manta soars.', 'At first, vedalken observers thought blinkmoths naturally avoided certain places. Then they realized those places were frogmite feeding grounds.', 'Bladehold houses a rogues\' gallery filled with the living "statues" of the worst enemies of the Auriok.', 'Blood is holy to those whose god is War.', 'Blood, bone, and sinew are magnified, as is the rage that drives them. The brain, however, remains unchanged—a little bean, swinging by a strand in a cavernous, raving head.', 'Centuries of wind, rain, and roots compressed into an instant of destruction: such is the power of Selesnya.', 'Changeling magic grants unusual wishes.', 'Disaster stalks with gaping jaws across unready lands.', 'Dragons consider drakes to be mockeries of their perfection, destroying them on sight.', 'Each Eldrazi ancient spawned a lineage of horrors in unfathomable shapes.', 'Each temple is a door to a horrible future.', "Even the clouds bend themselves to Memnarch's will, eager to swallow those who oppose him.", "Even the oldest treefolk was but an acorn when Lorwyn's first mysteries were born.", 'Even the small wounds let hope bleed out.', 'Every world is an organism, able to grow new lands. Some just do it faster than others.', 'Fire is always at the top of the food chain, and it has a big appetite.', "For Sarkhan Vol, the dragon is the purest expression of life's savage splendor.", 'For the Azorius, the law can be a physical shield against chaos and anarchy.', 'From the seeds of faith, great forests grow.', 'Greatness, at any cost.', 'Heavier than it looks, tricky to wield, guaranteed to last.', "His sickle was forged in the heat of another cinder's funeral pyre.", 'Hobgoblins are best left alone. They sharpen their farm implements far more than is necessary for their work in the fields.', "Hurkyl's research at the College of Lat-Nam wasn't enough to stop the two brothers, but for centuries thereafter her spellcraft taught artificers restraint.", "In Lorwyn's brief evenings, the sun pauses at the horizon long enough for a certain species of violet to bloom with the fragrance of mischief.", 'In desolate places, changelings may take the shape of fancies, or memories, or fears.', 'Instead of creating a tool that would be damaged by heat, the Thran built one that was charged by it.', 'It eats what it wants to eat—which is anything that moves.', 'It has a hundred thousand extinctions to avenge.', 'It is the forest beyond the horizon, the mountain waiting to be climbed, the new land across the endless sea.', 'It lurks just under the surface, using the algae-choked tar pits of Jund as both home and hunting blind.', "It nurtures its masters' glorious future.", "It's difficult to outwit something that doesn't speak, strategize, or even think.", 'Its fangs are in your flesh before its hiss leaves your ears.', 'Its predecessors were etched with the wisdom of ancients; its own etchings bear warnings of a future fraught with war.', 'Jund feasts on the unprepared.', "Jund's thallids tried to disguise their deliciousness by covering themselves in spines harvested from the tukatongue tree.", "Just as a changeling's influence can have dramatic effects, so too can its sudden withdrawal.", 'Kitesailing is a way of life—and without practice, the end of it.', 'Left without their leader Raksha, the leonin split into two prides: one side supported the regent kha, while the other rebelled in fury.', 'Life is ephemeral. Phyrexia is eternal.', "Life's circle has become inverted in Grixis. The same energy is endlessly recycled and becomes more stagnant with each pass.", 'Like blinking or breathing, responding to an alarm is an involuntary reflex.', 'Little agonies pave the way to greater power.', 'Long ago, the priests would wave the gohei to call down the gods. Now it lies forgotten, but the spirits still feel its pull.', 'Mages of Esper measure their wealth and status by the number of servants in their retinues.', 'Magnetic devices that keep massive golems and structures standing can also be used for the opposite purpose.', 'Many have heard the beginning of its low, sustained shriek but few the end.', 'Mastery is achieved when "telling time" becomes "telling time what to do."', 'Most myr monitor other species. Some myr monitor other myr.', 'Nature grows solutions to her problems.', 'No more shall the righteous cower before evil.', 'Now etched only with the scars of phyresis.', 'Now that he knows a thousand ways of hurting people, his next shamanic quest is to discover a thousand more.', 'Obsessed with the pursuit of knowledge above all else, vedalken can appear to be cold and emotionless.', "Phyrexian smog clouds choked the skies, threatening creatures who couldn't comprehend the menace below.", 'Rakdos festivals almost leave enough rubble in their wake to hide the bodies.', 'Scholars had puzzled for centuries over the ruins at Tal Terig. Its secrets had always lived within one rune-carved head.', 'She protects the sacred groves from blight, drought, and the Unbeholden.', 'Simic initiates begin their training as experimental subjects. Failures are flushed to the undersewers.', 'Some humans willingly offered up their blood, hoping it would grant the vampire families the strength to stave off the Eldrazi.', 'Some of the eleven minotaur clans of Mirtiin are expert crafters and learned philosophers. Others just like to hit stuff.', 'Some vampires reject the decadent trappings of their kind. Once they turn feral, no amount of blood will satisfy their hunger.', 'Some who scouted new lands chose to stay.', 'Structures built from darksteel yield to neither assault nor age.', 'Takenuma was filled with a chorus of moans, shrieks, and wails. Some came from the living, some from the dying, and some, most horribly, from the dead.', 'The Auriok see the artificer as a conduit, beckoning new creations into the world.', 'The Izzet learn something from every lesson they teach.', 'The Simic use the claws as scalpels, while the Rakdos use them for tattooing and torture. The Gruul use them to pick their teeth after lunching on the rest of the carcass.', 'The farther he roamed from Jund and its dragons, the more he felt their essence in himself.', 'The fatal flaw in every plan is the assumption that you know more than your enemy.', "The giant Tarvik dreamed that trinkets and machines caused all the world's woe. When he awoke from his troubled sleep, he took the name Tarvik Relicsmasher.", 'The lacerators cut themselves before each hunt. They must feed before the sun rises or bleed to death.', 'The most successful of Simic creations is cytoplasm, a living, symbiotic substance that feeds off genetic rhythms and strengthens its host in return.', "The sparkmage shrieked, calling on the rage of the storms of his youth. To his surprise, the sky responded with a fierce energy he'd never thought to see again.", "The strider's long, loping gait is an adaptation that allows it to move quickly in deep snow.", 'The suns of Mirrodin have shone upon perfection only once.', 'The swamps go silent at its approach, but it still hears the heartbeat of the prey within.', 'The vedalken interrogate all intruders—once the hoverguards are done with them.', 'There are few ways to escape the deathmark: bargaining with a demon, washing in the fabled waters of youth, and of course, death.', "Though you may see the same bones, you'll never see the same skeleton twice.", "Unaware of Lorwyn's diversity, it sees only itself, reflected a thousand times over.", "Vedalken eyes don't see the beauty in things. They see only what those things can teach.", 'Venser wondered if it could still be called a teleportation spell if the destination is oblivion.', 'War paint made from kolya fruit heightens senses and lessens fear. Unfortunately, fear is usually what keeps you alive.', "What doesn't grow, dies. And what dies grows the tarmogoyf.", 'When nature calls, *run*.', 'When necessary, myr can override and control any artificial object, as can their creator.', 'When outsiders interrupted the matca championship, things got ugly.', "When provoked, a flamekin's inner fire burns far hotter than any giant's forge.", 'When the Boros Legion attacks, swiftblades enter the fray first. They pick off the archers and mages, softening the enemy front before the flame-kin and giants go in.', 'Which is worse—the sleep which never ends or that which never comes?', 'Witches of the Split-Eye Coven speak of a future when Grixis will overflow with life energy. For now, they must harvest vis from the living to fuel their dark magics.', 'With or without witnesses, the suns continued their prismatic dance.']
artist: ['Adam Rex', 'Alan Pollack', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Alex Horley-Orlandelli', 'Allen Williams', 'Andrew Robinson', 'Anthony Francisco', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Anthony S. Waters', 'Arnie Swekel', 'Austin Hsu', 'Brad Rigney', 'Brian Despain', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Carl Frank', 'Chippy', 'Chris Rahn', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Chuck Lukacs', 'Clint Cearley', 'Cole Eastburn', 'Cyril Van Der Haegen', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Dany Orizio', 'Daren Bader', 'Darrell Riche', 'Dave Allsop', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Palumbo', 'Doug Chaffee', 'Drew Baker', 'Efrem Palacios', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Eric Fortune', 'Erica Yang', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Glen Angus', 'Goran Josic', 'Greg Hildebrandt', 'Greg Staples', 'Hideaki Takamura', 'Howard Lyon', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Paick', 'Jana Schirmer & Johannes Voss', 'Jason Chan', 'Jason Felix', 'Jeff Easley', 'Jeff Miracola', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Jim Murray', 'Jim Pavelec', 'Johann Bodin', 'Johannes Voss', 'John Avon', 'Jung Park', 'Justin Sweet', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kev Walker', 'Larry MacDougall', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Luca Zontini', 'Marc Simonetti', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Zug', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Michael Komarck', 'Michael Ryan', 'Michael Sutfin', 'Mike Bierek', 'Min Yum', 'Mitch Cotie', 'Pete Venters', 'Ralph Horsley', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Rebecca Guay', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ron Spears', 'Ron Spencer', 'Ryan Barger', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Sam Burley', 'Scott Hampton', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Shishizaru', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steven Belledin', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Thomas M. Baxa', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Trevor Claxton', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Véronique Meignaud', 'Wayne England', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Willian Murai', 'Zack Stella', 'Zoltan Boros', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai', 'rk post']
